  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: 2nd number = (1st number)² + 1\n\nGiven: 7 → 50\n\n7² + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50\n\n8 → 65\n\n8² + 1 = 64 + 1 = 65\n\nSo, 9 → ?\n\n? = 9² + 1 = 81 + 1 = 82\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
